#: includes/Admin/CapNotice.php:40
msgid "TrustOrder reached its hourly check limit in the last hour. While the limit was reached, buyers not checked yet kept every payment method while filling in the checkout. If your shop really has this many checkouts, raise the limit with the trustorder_hourly_check_limit filter."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/CapNotice.php:41
msgid "TrustOrder reached its place-order check limit for one visitor network in the last hour. For those orders the risky payment methods stayed hidden. If many buyers share one address (for example behind a proxy), set the real visitor address with the trustorder_client_ip filter, or raise the limit with trustorder_submit_ip_check_limit."
msgstr ""

